A custom tag on a module file's value is refused at the tag, wherever the value is.
--- project.yaml
modules: [libs/a, libs/b, libs/c]
--- libs/a/module.yaml
product: !foo jvm/lib
description: !bar
--- libs/b/module.yaml
product:
  type: !com.example.Type jvm/app
--- libs/c/module.yaml
product: !tagged
  type: jvm/lib
description: !text "x"
